Z||000000||Racer 1||11-21-1999||08:22 PM||||Hello,<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> I was wondering what kinda mods people did inside the 2.5 iron ducky engines to make them go faster? Im bored and got some $$ to burn  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. <P>Thanks||||reg||3
Z||000001||theogre||11-21-1999||09:10 PM||||quack lowder.||||reg||1
Z||000002||WKDFIRO||11-21-1999||09:59 PM||||Hooker Tri-Y Super Competition Header. Get rid of that dinky high school metal shop reject exhaust manifold. Years ago mine cost something like $200.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Cooter||11-21-1999||11:08 PM||||I have an MSD 6al and blaster coil on my DuckMobile. I dont know about better performance, but economy is pretty good. I added a "dual exhaust" v6 muffler to help with the sound, removed the baffle in the air intake. I have thought about taking the flow "wedge" out from under the throttle body to see if it gained any top end power, but I figure that GM must have a pretty good reason for putting it in there.||||reg||6
Z||000004||Monkeyman||11-22-1999||12:23 AM||||Hey, Racer 1...If you've got $$$ to burn, I need a loan!  Seriously, if you want better performance, why not replace the 4 with a 6?  Kick Hill sells the 2.8 and (supposedly) all of the change-over parts for less than a grand.  Then you could rebuild the 2.8 into a 3.1 (or maybe 3.2...hmmmmm).||||reg||1
Z||000005||Racer 1||11-22-1999||12:46 AM||||WKDFIRO,I already got the super comp tri-y's $230 from summit. I polished the TBI body on the inside. <P>Monkeyman,I thought about that but working on a 2.5 duck is hard enough I could just imagine a V-6 in there "HEADACHE" to work on.<P>I wanted some thought on how to squeeze out some EXTRA HP from inside the Duck make him fly alittle faster. <P>||||reg||14
Z||000006||Eddie||11-22-1999||06:57 PM||||RACER	1	<BR>	 GET BEHIND 2.8 GT OR SE AND ASK FOR A PUSH OR YOU COULD LOOK FOR A CLIFF BUT THAT MAY SCRATCH THE CAR. WHAT I DID IS I GOT A CAM NEW PISTONS I HAD THE VALVE HEAD DONE NEW CRANK AND NEW MAINS ALSO THE HEAD WAS SHAVED  AND NOW SHE FLY'S RIGHT.||||reg||7
